@startuml git-remote-clone-sequence
title Clone flow (Batch E)

actor User
participant "render_welcome\n(ide-ui)" as UI
participant "CloneState" as State
participant "background thread" as Thread
participant "ide_core::git::clone_repo" as Core
participant "git2 / libgit2" as Git2
participant "Project::open + scan_tree" as Project
participant "IdeApp" as App

User -> UI: type URL, choose destination, click Clone
UI -> State: start(url, dest)
State -> Thread: spawn
activate Thread
Thread -> Core: clone_repo(url, dest, on_progress)
activate Core
Core -> Core: validate url / dest
Core -> Git2: RepoBuilder::clone(url, dest)
loop transfer progress
  Git2 --> Core: transfer_progress callback
  Core --> Thread: on_progress(CloneProgress)
  Thread --> State: CloneEvent::Progress (mpsc)
end
Git2 --> Core: cloned repo (or Err)
Core -> Project: Project::open(dest).scan_tree()
Project --> Core: validated tree (escapes excluded)
Core --> Thread: Ok(GitRepo) / Err(GitError)
deactivate Core
Thread --> State: CloneEvent::Done(result) (mpsc)
deactivate Thread

loop every frame
  App -> State: poll()
  State --> App: Progress / Succeeded(path) / Failed / None
end
App -> App: open_project(path) on Succeeded
App --> User: project loaded, launcher replaced by editor

@enduml
